F calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. September to October came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, August to September came in at 43% of normal and April to May at 143%. Grid 25115 had its driest year in 1980 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
